meta {
  name: Authenticated requests
  seq: 4
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  The end-to-end upload journey, which begins with an authenticated call.
  Requests against fcp-sfd-object-processor inherit the collection bearer
  auth, which sends ACCESS_TOKEN, so run Get Access Token first to populate
  it.

  The two Upload to CDP Uploader requests are the exception: they post
  straight to the CDP Uploader at UPLOAD_URL, not to
  fcp-sfd-object-processor, so they send no bearer token. They are kept here
  because UPLOAD_URL only exists once the authenticated Initiate upload
  session has run.

  Order: Initiate upload session, then one of the two upload requests, then
  Get uploader scan status, then Get metadata by SBI and Get blob URL by
  file ID once the scan is ready.
}
